WEBVTT

00:06.610 --> 00:08.590
Ow...

00:08.950 --> 00:10.890
Where are we?

00:13.370 --> 00:14.860
Alina...

00:15.150 --> 00:16.130
You okay?

00:18.090 --> 00:20.520
Sorry! What about you? Are you okay?

00:22.530 --> 00:26.670
I wouldn't have minded being 
pinned under you a little longer.

00:27.930 --> 00:29.550
Stay asleep forever.

00:29.550 --> 00:31.510
I was kidding.

00:31.510 --> 00:34.160
Is everyone here?

00:34.160 --> 00:35.020
Yeah...

00:35.020 --> 00:38.350
Ow... Man, that really sucked.

00:38.350 --> 00:40.800
Looks like the hole's closed over.

00:42.030 --> 00:45.270
I've never heard of anything 
being under guild headquarters.

00:45.650 --> 00:47.270
What is this place?

00:47.270 --> 00:51.030
It must be the realm of the dead!

00:51.030 --> 00:53.110
The realm of the dead?

00:53.110 --> 01:00.410
We were dropped here by the reaper that
 takes adventurers to the realm of the dead!

01:00.410 --> 01:04.160
I don't think a reaper would 
use cheap tricks like traps.

01:04.160 --> 01:08.130
It'd use, like, some supernatural 
phenomenon that defies understanding.

01:08.130 --> 01:11.010
Well, it's a prudent sort of reaper!

01:11.010 --> 01:14.510
What even is a "prudent sort of reaper"?

01:16.140 --> 01:17.410
Could this be...

01:17.830 --> 01:20.970
a hidden floor of the Fortress of Ash?

01:22.090 --> 01:24.580
Maybe the adventurers who disappeared

01:24.580 --> 01:27.570
actually fell into this trap.

01:28.410 --> 01:31.850
The monsters on hidden floors 
are usually high-level,

01:32.200 --> 01:36.200
so an adventurer separated from their party
 likely wouldn't make it back alive.

01:36.510 --> 01:38.970
Oh, I get it.

01:40.430 --> 01:42.540
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

01:42.540 --> 01:45.470
Could you not make jokes that aren't even funny?

01:45.800 --> 01:50.880
I'm already freaking out over the discovery 
of a massive seven-floor dungeon.

01:50.880 --> 01:54.760
That alone is gonna trap me 
in overtime hell for weeks!

01:54.760 --> 01:59.520
I don't have time to deal with 
an ancient dungeon that someone

01:59.520 --> 02:01.720
forgot to complete on top of that!

02:01.720 --> 02:04.110
Someone's really gonna die this time!

02:05.000 --> 02:07.990
Wait... Please don't make that face!

02:09.060 --> 02:14.030
My hope of escaping overtime was 
shattered by the ultimate workaholic,

02:14.390 --> 02:17.870
and a ghost interrupted the overtime 
work that was dumped on me.

02:17.870 --> 02:19.550
I'm so done!

02:19.550 --> 02:20.800
Alina...

02:20.800 --> 02:24.660
If the overtime's too hard,
I'll help you as much as you need.

02:26.740 --> 02:32.750
But who dropped us down here 
if it wasn't a reaper?

02:33.830 --> 02:35.220
The man in black.

02:35.680 --> 02:37.030
Precisely.

02:40.040 --> 02:41.590
I am...

02:42.090 --> 02:44.030
the "man in black."

02:46.310 --> 02:48.760
<i>I didn't even sense his presence.</i>

02:48.760 --> 02:52.810
<i>It's as if he stopped time
 and teleported here!</i>

02:52.810 --> 02:55.770
Just what are you after?!

02:59.010 --> 03:00.220
Who are you?!

03:02.280 --> 03:06.080
I believe you know the answer to that.

03:11.670 --> 03:14.570
G-Guildmaster?

04:48.020 --> 04:50.260
You can't... be serious.

04:50.260 --> 04:54.770
Stop joking around. It really isn't funny.

04:57.460 --> 05:00.720
Little lady, this will be the end of it.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.400
I'm counting on you.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.590
Seriously, stop making jokes—

05:04.590 --> 05:07.160
So it really was you!

05:07.660 --> 05:11.620
This is what you meant to ask me 
about earlier today, isn't it?

05:11.850 --> 05:13.000
Yes.

05:13.730 --> 05:17.500
I evaded it on the spot by 
bringing up my daughter.

05:17.500 --> 05:20.450
I was relieved when you backed down after that.

05:21.170 --> 05:23.930
You really are such a kind boy!

05:26.700 --> 05:27.800
But you are naïve.

05:28.800 --> 05:33.620
You should have questioned me the 
moment you started to suspect me.

05:33.940 --> 05:38.900
Even if I am the guildmaster in whom 
you've placed your utmost faith.

05:40.110 --> 05:43.840
You have a tendency to 
escape to wishful thinking.

05:44.250 --> 05:49.090
That naïve thinking will one day mean 
the death of those you hold dear.

05:49.090 --> 05:50.510
I guarantee it.

05:50.510 --> 05:53.490
Explain this. Explain yourself!

05:53.950 --> 05:55.850
Explain everything that led up to this!

05:56.160 --> 05:58.120
I know perfectly well

05:59.130 --> 06:03.950
that it was naïve of me not to question 
you the moment I suspected you!

06:04.810 --> 06:07.530
But it was because you...

06:08.190 --> 06:10.810
Because you believed in Silver Sword!

06:11.940 --> 06:14.910
I believe this is the right choice.

06:15.850 --> 06:17.730
Was that a lie, too?!

06:17.730 --> 06:20.600
Did you give us special attention 
so you could make us your pawns?!

06:20.860 --> 06:22.360
Well?!

06:24.220 --> 06:25.280
Follow me.

06:26.820 --> 06:28.420
There is something I want to show you.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.030
Hold it!

06:33.200 --> 06:34.250
Damn it!

06:34.910 --> 06:37.300
What is that old fart thinking?

06:37.860 --> 06:40.190
I-It's not true!

06:41.180 --> 06:43.370
It's some kind of mistake!

06:43.980 --> 06:45.080
It must be...

06:46.090 --> 06:48.550
Isn't it, Jade?!

06:48.550 --> 06:49.530
Lululee.

06:50.070 --> 06:51.890
This is the truth.

06:52.210 --> 06:53.330
No...

06:54.140 --> 06:58.120
When did you start to suspect 
that Glen was the man in black?

06:59.550 --> 07:01.720
Heitz was able to access
 the underground prison,

07:02.280 --> 07:05.180
as well the underground archive 
where the secret quest was stored.

07:06.280 --> 07:09.740
The guildmaster would have the 
ability to let him into both.

07:10.900 --> 07:11.870
I see.

07:12.590 --> 07:14.390
So what now, leader?

07:15.210 --> 07:17.250
It could be a trap, but...

07:18.000 --> 07:19.050
We're going.

07:26.130 --> 07:29.250
She was abandoned?

07:29.690 --> 07:34.480
Yes. Would you mind
 becoming her father, Glen?

07:34.480 --> 07:38.930
Master, if she's an orphan, could you 
not entrust her to an orphanage?

07:40.160 --> 07:44.460
You're able to abandon others so easily,
even your own comrades.

07:44.460 --> 07:47.420
Truly an opinion worthy of you,

07:47.420 --> 07:50.150
the man who hasn't an ounce of humanity in him.

07:50.800 --> 07:53.780
I'm under no obligation to be her father,

07:53.780 --> 07:57.530
and there's no law saying an 
adventurer has to save orphans.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.980
This is training.

07:59.980 --> 08:01.290
Training?

08:01.620 --> 08:04.190
Training to have a family.

08:04.190 --> 08:07.400
Training to love and be loved.

08:07.400 --> 08:10.300
You are far too strait-laced.

08:10.300 --> 08:13.850
I don't understand what benefit 
such training would bring.

08:24.370 --> 08:27.400
I'm hungry.

08:46.210 --> 08:47.510
A boss room?

08:48.090 --> 08:50.220
It used to be a boss room.

08:50.960 --> 08:54.680
It is also where the Silver Sword 
of two generations ago,

08:54.970 --> 08:57.710
my partymates, lost their lives.

08:59.390 --> 09:03.230
We were just one strike away 
from defeating the boss.

09:03.900 --> 09:05.280
It was instant.

09:05.280 --> 09:08.310
In a mere instant,
they were all burned to a crisp.

09:20.120 --> 09:23.270
Lynn! Lynn!

09:25.660 --> 09:29.060
I was the only one fortunate enough 
to avoid the flames and survive.

09:30.130 --> 09:34.340
And then I learned a way to 
bring people back from the dead.

09:35.240 --> 09:37.340
Back from the dead?!

09:37.340 --> 09:41.770
I rebuilt the Fortress of Ash 
into the guild headquarters,

09:42.420 --> 09:45.470
keeping its underground level a secret.

09:46.410 --> 09:50.360
All so I could keep this place exactly 
as it was all those years ago.

09:50.970 --> 09:55.640
Turning back time requires more 
effort the more things have changed.

09:56.070 --> 10:00.570
A bare ruin can be traced 
back even farther in time.

10:00.570 --> 10:03.200
You're going to turn back 
the time in this room?!

10:03.200 --> 10:04.930
Exactly.

10:04.930 --> 10:10.830
But even if you do that,
your power only allows you to observe!

10:11.080 --> 10:13.490
So what's the point of doing it?!

10:13.940 --> 10:19.250
To bend the laws of nature,
change the past, and do it all over again

10:19.250 --> 10:20.840
requires one thing:

10:21.690 --> 10:23.850
the power of a dark god's core.

10:23.850 --> 10:25.430
A dark god's core?!

10:26.730 --> 10:32.190
I became guildmaster in order 
to retrieve a dark god's core.

10:32.700 --> 10:35.910
There was no position more 
ideal for finding a dark god

10:35.910 --> 10:38.620
hidden within a secret quest.

10:39.860 --> 10:43.030
But after searching for over a decade,

10:43.030 --> 10:47.670
I couldn't even find any adventurers 
strong enough to fight a dark god,

10:47.670 --> 10:49.620
much less complete a secret quest.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.750
Which is why...

10:51.050 --> 10:56.630
When I found you, young lady, I gave 
thanks to the gods for the first time.

11:00.470 --> 11:03.130
She's not so much an Executioner 
as a wrathful deity.

11:03.130 --> 11:04.890
No, a dark god.

11:04.890 --> 11:07.520
She might even surpass a dark god.

11:08.020 --> 11:11.910
The little lady could fight 
a dark god on even footing.

11:11.910 --> 11:14.230
I was convinced of that.

11:14.450 --> 11:19.400
So your intention was to make 
Alina fight a dark god from the start?!

11:19.400 --> 11:20.720
Yes.

11:20.720 --> 11:22.660
I used Rufus and Heitz,

11:22.660 --> 11:25.610
and anything else I could, 
to fulfill my objective.

11:25.610 --> 11:28.080
That's not what I'm asking you!

11:28.300 --> 11:30.410
My one miscalculation

11:30.720 --> 11:33.840
was that the solution
I found was a receptionist.

11:34.510 --> 11:38.100
That's why I threw you at that dark god, Jade.

11:39.000 --> 11:43.760
Because I knew she wouldn't leave 
you to be killed by a dark god.

11:43.760 --> 11:48.100
She's a kind girl, so she would 
fight it out of compassion.

11:48.100 --> 11:49.270
Cut the crap!

11:52.390 --> 11:57.400
Do you have any idea how Alina 
felt when she fought that thing?!

11:57.400 --> 11:58.730
Compassion?!

11:59.160 --> 12:03.990
Alina fought so she wouldn't lose 
someone she cared about again!

12:04.290 --> 12:06.780
And you used her pain for your own ends?!

12:06.780 --> 12:07.830
Jade.

12:08.780 --> 12:11.770
I think I'm the one who's 
supposed to be angry here.

12:12.530 --> 12:13.790
Sorry.

12:14.040 --> 12:17.630
So in other words, the reason 
I've been dragged into all this

12:17.860 --> 12:20.050
was to be part of your plan?

12:20.790 --> 12:22.130
That's right.

12:22.130 --> 12:25.850
I really wish you'd stop putting 
me through all these headaches.

12:28.460 --> 12:32.880
There was someone who gave me a reason 
to live after I had lost all hope.

12:33.270 --> 12:38.160
That is who taught me how to 
bring people back from the dead.

12:38.610 --> 12:39.740
Who?

12:40.280 --> 12:42.900
To redo the past...

12:43.400 --> 12:47.450
I have lived to this day clinging to that goal.

12:47.450 --> 12:52.330
And at long last, I've been given 
permission to use a dark god's core.

12:52.740 --> 12:55.600
I couldn't accept my daughter's death.

12:56.290 --> 12:59.840
To acquire a dark god's power 
and bring Lynn back...

12:59.840 --> 13:04.590
That is my goal—the goal of the man in black!

13:04.910 --> 13:07.500
Still, what do you expect to 
do with a dark god's core?

13:08.050 --> 13:11.560
It's only the heart of a dark god,
 created by our ancestors!

13:11.900 --> 13:14.830
You are mistaken about one thing.

13:15.370 --> 13:19.110
To call it a dark god's heart is not wrong,

13:19.110 --> 13:22.030
but its true value is realized...

13:22.250 --> 13:26.780
when it is implanted in a human, 
turning them into a dark god.

13:27.010 --> 13:29.630
Turning a human... into a dark god?!

13:29.990 --> 13:33.580
Yes. The dark gods you've fought previously

13:34.000 --> 13:36.690
were people who cast aside
 their human hearts...

13:37.210 --> 13:40.130
as I have now.

13:41.010 --> 13:43.260
A d-dark god's core?!

13:47.750 --> 13:51.890
With this, I can obtain great 
power in exchange for my soul,

13:51.890 --> 13:53.930
and even become a dark god.

13:54.650 --> 13:56.810
I swore on these graves

13:56.810 --> 14:01.310
that I would only come back here when 
the time came to achieve my goal.

14:01.750 --> 14:05.490
I will get my daughter, Lynn, back.

14:05.490 --> 14:07.990
The dead can't be brought back!

14:07.990 --> 14:12.370
Even you must know something so obvious!

14:13.210 --> 14:16.010
There is something I must tell her.

14:16.010 --> 14:21.160
Something I never got to say to her 
because of my own foolish pride.

14:23.920 --> 14:27.880
I keep telling you to stop 
making that scary face,

14:28.110 --> 14:29.520
Dad!

14:29.520 --> 14:31.680
Don't call me that.

14:32.180 --> 14:33.810
Let go of me.

14:33.810 --> 14:36.420
Oh, come on, Dad!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.730
Enough. Listen to me.

14:37.730 --> 14:40.830
My next job will be in a very large dungeon.

14:40.830 --> 14:43.510
If I'm not back in two weeks,

14:43.510 --> 14:45.610
use the money in the drawer to buy food.

14:46.050 --> 14:49.720
Stop talking like you're reading me 
your will every time you go to work!

14:50.240 --> 14:54.580
I'll be happy as long as you 
come back alive and well.

14:54.970 --> 14:57.310
I'm not asking whether you'll be happy.

14:57.720 --> 15:01.660
Do not neglect your daily 
training in my absence.

15:01.660 --> 15:05.420
Become a proper adventurer quickly 
so you can live on your own.

15:05.420 --> 15:06.590
Yeah, yeah.

15:06.590 --> 15:08.070
I know.

15:08.070 --> 15:12.180
I'll join Silver Sword someday 
and take care of you.

15:12.890 --> 15:16.520
Silver Sword is not as 
simple as you think it is.

15:16.840 --> 15:19.320
Of course I know it's not easy.

15:19.320 --> 15:23.020
I mean, all you ever do is train,
even on your days off.

15:23.020 --> 15:24.090
But you know...

15:24.770 --> 15:26.490
I think that's really cool.

15:26.490 --> 15:29.760
I'm gonna work hard so
I can join Silver Sword, too!

15:30.150 --> 15:33.570
Then I'll be with you, so you 
won't feel lonely, right?

15:34.010 --> 15:35.190
Again...

15:35.190 --> 15:39.000
'Cause I love you, Dad!

15:39.000 --> 15:40.710
What's that supposed to mean?

15:41.210 --> 15:44.910
Adventurers could die on 
the job at any time, right?

15:44.910 --> 15:49.760
So I was thinking, I should say,
"I love you," when I have the chance!

15:49.980 --> 15:51.700
Well? What about you, Dad?

15:51.700 --> 15:55.200
You gotta say, "I love you, too." Come on!

15:56.100 --> 15:58.670
Why haven't you come to hate me?

16:00.440 --> 16:04.060
I only took you in because 
my master forced me to.

16:04.060 --> 16:09.380
What will it take to make you 
hate me and leave this house?

16:10.000 --> 16:14.970
Well... I know what kinds of 
people are actually scary people.

16:16.200 --> 16:20.890
When I lived in the alley, 
no one would even look at me.

16:21.580 --> 16:25.540
Even when I was cold and 
hungry and begging for help,

16:25.540 --> 16:28.660
everyone just walked by and 
pretended they didn't see me.

16:30.550 --> 16:36.710
But you stayed with me, even if you kept 
grumbling that it was just training.

16:36.710 --> 16:41.140
You looked at me, and you talked 
to me, and it made me so happy!

16:41.140 --> 16:42.560
That's why...

16:43.920 --> 16:44.970
I love you!

16:54.810 --> 16:55.910
I'm going now.

16:55.910 --> 16:58.730
Take care, Dad!

17:01.590 --> 17:05.780
We didn't share blood or any other connection,

17:05.780 --> 17:08.080
but she was most definitely my daughter.

17:11.000 --> 17:13.510
Little lady, this will be the end of it.

17:13.830 --> 17:16.720
Will you hear my last wish?

17:17.530 --> 17:18.520
Wish?

17:19.280 --> 17:23.210
I will use my soul to activate 
the dark god's core.

17:23.650 --> 17:28.140
It will likely consume my will, 
leaving behind only a dark god.

17:29.060 --> 17:31.070
When that happens...

17:31.730 --> 17:34.030
I want you to kill me.

17:36.740 --> 17:37.670
Chant!

17:38.300 --> 17:41.120
<b>Dia Chronos</b>

17:38.530 --> 17:40.210
Dia Chronos!

17:42.200 --> 17:43.520
A Dia skill?!

18:15.930 --> 18:16.630
Huh?

18:17.070 --> 18:19.450
Jade? Guys?

18:21.820 --> 18:22.860
Lynn...

18:22.860 --> 18:26.140
Why? Why did you have to die?

18:27.130 --> 18:29.050
I didn't get a chance to tell you anything.

18:29.470 --> 18:31.830
I haven't told you... anything.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.490
Lynn... Lynn...

18:45.470 --> 18:48.310
Ah, poor Glen.

18:48.310 --> 18:54.230
I shall bestow upon you the 
means to escape this grief.

19:02.530 --> 19:03.910
Why?!

19:03.910 --> 19:06.950
Why can't I turn time back any farther?!

19:07.190 --> 19:09.300
It's so close!

19:09.760 --> 19:12.170
So close to the time when Lynn was still alive!

19:12.480 --> 19:14.790
What? What happened?!

19:14.790 --> 19:16.320
Skill activate!

19:15.520 --> 19:18.730
<b>Dia Break</b>

19:16.320 --> 19:17.540
Dia Break!

19:18.730 --> 19:22.800
Glen! Don't get mad at me 
for crushing your left hand!

19:25.660 --> 19:26.390
Huh?!

19:30.570 --> 19:32.360
One more time.

19:35.160 --> 19:37.550
Even if you change the past and bring her back,

19:37.550 --> 19:40.990
she won't be happy about it if you're dead!

19:41.350 --> 19:43.950
Don't you know better than anyone

19:43.950 --> 19:46.670
how much it hurts when someone you love dies?!

19:50.180 --> 19:52.540
You kids wouldn't understand.

19:53.050 --> 19:54.710
Parents can die.

19:54.710 --> 19:57.880
No matter how bloodstained 
these hands become....

19:58.260 --> 20:00.930
Even if I stray from the path of humanity...

20:01.430 --> 20:03.680
Even if I become a monster...

20:04.010 --> 20:07.060
If it means Lynn can live with a smile,

20:07.300 --> 20:09.560
I'll happily give my life!

20:10.810 --> 20:13.730
Chant! Dia Chronos!

20:26.190 --> 20:28.290
After throwing away my human soul

20:29.080 --> 20:32.740
and using the suffering 
of others for my own gain,

20:33.480 --> 20:36.710
this... is where I end up?

20:41.100 --> 20:43.610
I'm sorry, Lynn.

20:44.940 --> 20:50.600
Why did I insist on bringing 
her up to be an adventurer?

20:51.530 --> 20:56.900
Why was I so happy when I learned 
that she would join Silver Sword?

20:58.170 --> 21:03.190
Watching my daughter turn 
to ash right before my eyes

21:04.150 --> 21:07.830
has finally made me see what a fool I was.

21:11.470 --> 21:13.770
Lynn... Lynn...

21:14.370 --> 21:16.730
What can I do?

21:17.910 --> 21:22.300
What can I do... to see you again?

21:24.180 --> 21:25.050
Alina!

21:39.040 --> 21:41.010
Fool...

21:41.010 --> 21:43.150
What a foolish man.

21:51.300 --> 21:52.830
The Dia Emblem...

21:53.050 --> 21:55.840
Ah, that's right.

21:56.730 --> 22:01.340
Eating humans will give me power.

22:01.960 --> 22:04.840
The dark god's core consumed Glen's will?!

22:05.800 --> 22:08.890
Chant! Dia Chronos!

23:51.990 --> 24:00.250
<b>Next Time</b>

23:51.990 --> 24:00.250
<b>I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
But I'll Fight to the Bitter End to Get Out of Working Overtime</b>

23:52.930 --> 23:53.830
Next time,

23:53.830 --> 23:55.450
"I May Be a Guild Receptionist,

23:55.450 --> 23:58.950
But I'll Fight to the Bitter End 
to Get Out of Working Overtime."
